# Allowlist: only send what Dockerfiles/core/Dockerfile needs.
# The repo root also holds runtime data (postgresql-data, vmail-data, ...) that must never enter the build.
*
!Dockerfiles/core/
!core/

core/frontend/node_modules
core/frontend/dist
core/frontend/coverage
core/frontend/.pnpm-store
core/public/dist
core/data
core/logs
core/billionmail*
**/.claude
